        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Mercer University, Atlantic Sun Conference, NCAA Division I\n- Teams: 2012–13 Mercer Bears men's basketball team\n- People: Bob Hoffman\n- Places: Hawkins Arena, Macon, Georgia\n\nFacts:\n- Mercer University is the oldest private university in Georgia, and its main campus is in Macon, Georgia, United States.\n- The 2012–13 Mercer Bears men's basketball team represented Mercer University during the 2012–13 NCAA Division I men's basketball season.\n- The 2012–13 Mercer Bears men's basketball team was led by fifth-year head coach Bob Hoffman.\n- The 2012–13 Mercer Bears men's basketball team played its home games at Hawkins Arena on Mercer University's Macon, Georgia campus.\n- The 2012–13 Mercer Bears men's basketball team was a member of the Atlantic Sun Conference.",
